OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1786291455
OL,3,CBritish tennis number one Emma
OL,4,CRaducanu to miss US Open with stress
OL,5,Cfracture
OL,7,FEmma Raducanu's stress fracture will
OL,8,Fforce her to miss the US Open, it is
OL,9,Funderstood.
OL,11,FThe British number one suffered the
OL,12,Finjury to her right lower leg during
OL,13,Fthe grass-court season and made a late
OL,14,Fdecision to pull out of Wimbledon.
OL,16,FIt is understood that following
OL,17,Fconsultation with her medical team,
OL,18,FRaducanu has concluded she will be
OL,19,Funable to play in New York later this
OL,20,Fmonth.
