OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1786291455
OL,3,CBritish tennis number one Emma
OL,4,CRaducanu to miss US Open with stress
OL,5,Cfracture
OL,7,FRaducanu has only recently taken her
OL,8,Ffirst tentative steps back on court
OL,9,Fwearing a protective boot; her
OL,10,Fwithdrawal from the US Open is another
OL,11,Fblow to the 23-year-old.
OL,13,FHaving made positive progress last
OL,14,Fsummer, including winning her first
OL,15,Fmatches at Flushing Meadows since
OL,16,Flifting the trophy five years ago, it
OL,17,Fhas been a frustrating 12 months for
OL,18,FRaducanu with more persistent physical
OL,19,Fissues.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
