FL,315,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1786291455
OL,3,CBritish tennis number one Emma
OL,4,CRaducanu to miss US Open with stress
OL,5,Cfracture
OL,7,FAfter a foot injury severely hampered
OL,8,Fher pre-season training, Raducanu then
OL,9,Fspent two-and-a-half months off court
OL,10,Fwith a post-viral illness after
OL,11,Finitially falling unwell in early
OL,12,FFebruary.
OL,14,FShe finally returned for the end of
OL,15,Fthe clay-court season having rehired
OL,16,FAndrew Richardson, the coach who
OL,17,Fguided her to the US Open title, but
OL,18,Fthe pair's time on court together has
OL,19,Fbeen limited.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
