PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1786291455
OL,3,CBritish tennis number one Emma
OL,4,CRaducanu to miss US Open with stress
OL,5,Cfracture
OL,7,FShe was not among the players named in
OL,8,FGreat Britain's team for the Billie
OL,9,FJean King Cup Finals in late
OL,10,FSeptember, and there must be question
OL,11,Fmarks over whether Raducanu, who will
OL,12,Fslide from her current ranking of 49,
OL,13,Fwill compete again in 2026.
OL,15,FThe Kent player did post an upbeat
OL,16,Fmessage on Instagram on Sunday from a
OL,17,Fbreak in Switzerland, calling it the
OL,18,F"best reset ever".
